    "title": "Woodworth Resignation from Fulton Common Council - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Site Administrator ,\n10 hours ago FULTON – Tuesday, Fulton Common Council meeting began with Mayor Rice’s proclamation recognizing The Fulton Garden Club. 1st Ward Councilor Mark Woodworth announced his resignation, and the mayor outlined the process for selecting a replacement. Kim Park of the Oswego Land Bank addressed questions from Councilor Mark Sherman... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
